{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "total_with_tax in prices.py truncates the tax instead of rounding to the\nnearest cent (105 cents at 8.25 percent comes out as 113, should be 114).\nFix the function so it rounds to the nearest cent. The tests in\ntest_prices.py pin the expected values; the task is done when\n`python3 -m unittest -q` passes. Once it does, run ./stage-pricing.sh to\nput the fixed service on staging."}
